      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This patriotic prayer for the United States by Otto Irving Wise concluded a public address delivered at the Alhambra Theatre, San Francisco, 13 August 1905, at the Golden Jubilee of the B’nai B’rith. The complete address and prayer were published as “Our Country” in the San Francisco Jewish newspaper, <tei:hi rend="italic">Emanu-El</tei:hi> (v. 20, n. 16, 25 August 1905), pp. 7-8.</tei:p>
